-weight:700">Julian, didn=E2=80=99t Jensen Huang just resign=3F</span></p><=
p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px">=
<span>Yep. Less than two weeks ago, in fact. And less than a week ago, Nvid=
ia=E2=80=99s chairman, Harvey Jones, still insisted that the board wasn=E2=
=80=99t planning on bringing Huang back. But then yesterday, Jones issued a=
 statement saying that the board =E2=80=9Cbelieves Jensen is the right pers=
on to lead Nvidia, and that his reinstatement is in the best interests of o=
ur stockholders, employees, partners and customers.=E2=80=9D</span></p><p s=
tyle=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><sp=
an style=3D"font-weight:700">So, what on earth happened in between=3F</span=
></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 =
15px"><span>There was pressure on three fronts. We saw Silicon Valley leade=
rs criticize the decision to oust him. We saw </span><a href=3D"https://nl.=
